<section data-variant="light" style="background: var(--bg); padding: var(--space-8); border-radius: var(--radius-surface)">
    <p class="eyebrow">Print preview</p>
    <h3>The page as it will be printed</h3>
    <p>A light surface inside a dark page, for a preview that has to look like paper.</p>
    <p>
        <a class="btn btn--brand btn--solid" href="#">Print</a>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="#">Download</a>
        <span class="badge badge--warn">Draft</span>
    </p>
    <div class="card"><div class="card-body">A card on the light surface keeps its own border and fill.</div></div>
</section>
